      "level": 3,
      "text": "Set a default theme for your workspace"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Each workspace can pick the theme every new doc starts with. Admins set it once; every member who starts a blank doc in this workspace gets that design. They can still pick a template with its own design, but the baseline is yours.",
