    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Pick a preset"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "The grid lists every built-in preset (and any themes you've saved personally). Click a card to set it as the workspace default: the change persists immediately, no save button.",
